{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.151.41.136","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81026,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c857b0fc66fa52835f59787a6c01d9e9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Everyone!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m new here, I&#039;m planning my wedding for April 2018 in the Riviera Maya and I am so excited!! I&#039;m also super overwhelmed! With planning a destination wedding it seems the resort takes care of most of it, and they also don&#039;t contact you until 3 months out so I&#039;m not sure what if anything I need to be doing now. I&#039;ve got a pinterest board going but any advice would be greatly appreciated!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917645,"PostDate":1493740095,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Everyone!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm new here, I'm planning my wedding for April 2018 in the Riviera Maya and I am so excited!! I'm also super overwhelmed! With planning a destination wedding it seems the resort takes care of most of it, and they also don't contact you until 3 months out so I'm not sure what if anything I need to be doing now. I've got a pinterest board going but any advice would be greatly appreciated!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brittymack007@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.151.41.136","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1493739884,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"futuremrs2018","Id":288812,"Name":"futuremrs2018","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81026,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b281a35decfc844cb81e949177c8c355","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi There, FutureMrs2018!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;TA Wendy here!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Welcome and I hope you find lots of help and information here on the BDW forum pages!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;One of the first orders of business in doing planning for a Destination Wedding is selecting a resort and blocking your rooms for your group.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We at Wright Travel are experts in working with all of the tour operators and resorts and are here to help you with the entire process!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Please let us know how we can help! if you click the Contact Me button at the top one of our experienced agents will contact you back and answer any and all of your questions about the process!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;TA Wendy&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1917646,"PostDate":1493740399,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi There, FutureMrs2018!<\/p>\n<p>TA Wendy here!<\/p>\n<p>Welcome and I hope you find lots of help and information here on the BDW forum pages!<\/p>\n<p>One of the first orders of business in doing planning for a Destination Wedding is selecting a resort and blocking your rooms for your group.<\/p>\n<p>We at Wright Travel are experts in working with all of the tour operators and resorts and are here to help you with the entire process!<\/p>\n<p>Please let us know how we can help! if you click the Contact Me button at the top one of our experienced agents will contact you back and answer any and all of your questions about the process!<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning!<\/p>\n<p>TA Wendy<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wendyhicks1@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1238012640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216154.jpg?_r=1419958783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Wendy","Id":216154,"Name":"TA Wendy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.240.200.36","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":81026,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"720544782dd3aa284ba7799f3feee184","RawContent":"Welcome!  I was an April bride too and it was the perfect month to get married on the beach!  Congratulations!\n\n\nAs for planning and next steps, what do you already have done?  Resort picked? Save the dates sent? Guest list?","Attachments":[],"Id":1917694,"PostDate":1494783526,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\